  "plot_summary": "[HANG0] The letters page of [LINK:1963:FF_17|FF #17] concludes with this:\n[HANG] <i>So, till next ish, read our mags, read our competitors' mags, but READ!</i>\n[HANG]<i> It's one of the greatest pleasures of all!</i>\n\n[ASSET: right | MarvelAgeOfComics | width=12%] [HANG0] It seemed like just about every book had something to the effect of:\n[BR]\n[BR] \"Marvel Comics Group ushers in 'The Marvel Age of Comics'\" on the cover.",
